{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:29 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:29 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:29 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"清水灣道男子捱小巴撞捲車底 重創浴血昏迷送院\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42748eb1c2bbe12226a8a283f42b044f/2026-11/ha_tko.jpg\"/><p>清水灣道大坳門路迴旋處對開，今日（11月25日）下午6時半左右，一名男子意外被小巴撞倒，男子被捲入車底，重創浴血，登時人事不省。消防趕至將其救出，救護員其後將他送往將軍澳醫院搶救。目前意外原因仍待調查。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T11:54:48.000607+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:29:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:05:25.449931+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T11:48:13.571786+00:00","content_hash":"adf80b9b3fd03bd61406e013aa41022e7965c2b2e261901aeb91fb7a67a2989d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}